<title>POLAND: S &amp; P may give Warta new rating.</title>
<headline>S &amp; P may give Warta new rating.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rating agency Standard &amp; Poor's is likely to carry out its own audit of TUiR Warta SA in 1997, which might result in increasing the Polish insurer's current B+ rating next year, Warta's deputy president said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;We hope that Standard &amp; Poor's will carry its own audit of 1996 results and next year we could have another rating,&quot; Jan Durajczyk told a news conference.</p>
<p>He did not give any other details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
